Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

How many paid vacation days do full-time employees receive per year?

### PDF RAG (add PDF files to data/pdfs first)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/documents/ask
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

Summarize the policy in the documents.
